      h2: "What to ask instead of 'are you licensed?'",
      html: `<p>Since "are you licensed" isn't really the right question in Indiana, ask these instead: Which certification do you hold, and is it current? How many inspections have you completed? Do you carry E&amp;O and general liability insurance, and can I see proof? Do you offer a sample report I can review before booking? These four questions do the job that a state license would otherwise be doing for you in a different state.</p>`
