      html: `<p>Walk the perimeter and look up: check for shingles that curled, cracked, or lifted over winter, and check flashing around chimneys and roof vents for gaps that opened up during freeze-thaw cycling. Clean gutters and downspouts of winter debris and confirm downspouts extend at least 4–6 feet away from the foundation — a shockingly common and easily fixed issue we find on nearly every inspection.</p>`
