      html: `<p>Indoor relative humidity above roughly 60% starts to create conditions where mold can establish itself and spread, and Indianapolis summers regularly push outdoor humidity well past that threshold for weeks at a time. A dehumidifier in a finished or semi-finished basement is one of the single most effective preventive tools available, especially in homes without a fully conditioned basement space tied into the main HVAC system.</p>`
