      html: `<p>Some multi-family properties have a single shared furnace or water heater serving multiple units at once; others have fully separate mechanical systems for each individual unit. This distinction directly affects both your ongoing operating costs as an owner and what needs focused, individual attention during the inspection itself — a shared system failure affects every tenant at once, which raises the stakes considerably on catching issues early rather than after a complaint.</p>`
